sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Git as GitHub
    participant CI as GitHub Actions
    participant Registry as GHCR
    participant Argo as ArgoCD
    participant EKS as EKS

    Dev->>Git: Merge PR to main
    Git->>CI: Trigger CI and release workflow
    CI->>CI: Type check, test, build
    CI->>Registry: Push sha-tagged images
    CI->>CI: Scan images
    CI->>Git: Commit updated Helm image tags
    Argo->>Git: Poll or receive webhook
    Argo->>EKS: Sync desired state
    EKS->>EKS: Rolling update with probes
    Argo->>Git: Report synced and healthy
